{"title":"A day in Toronto, Royal Winter Fair version!!","startsAt":"2026-11-07T09:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-07T20:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"This is an open invitation to anyone interested in attending the Royal Winter Fair in Toronto.\n\nPlan would be to meet at the Oshawa Go Station and ride in to Exhibition Station.\n\nAfter a period of time at the Fair, we could grab an early dinner in Liberty Village, a short walk away.\n\nIf interested, please share thoughts/comment.\n\nFair runs November 6th through to the 15th.\n(I’m flexible on date to visit)","venue":{"name":"Coca-Cola coliseum","address":"33 princes blvd, Toronto","lat":43.634705,"lng":-79.40972,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Peterborough Outdoor Activity","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/7/8/7/a/highres_501330842.jpeg"}